{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object. If object visible, approach it. If object not seen, scan area. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectTask    /> <Condition ID = IsAreaScanned    /> <Action ID = MoveToScanArea    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />",
